            ["discover.eyebrow"]="DISCOVER HIDDEN MK",["discover.title"]="Start with curiosity.",["discover.subtitle"]="Follow it somewhere unexpected.",["discover.beyond"]="BEYOND THE OBVIOUS",["discover.looking"]="What are you looking for?",["discover.lookingText"]="Whether you’re searching for a quiet mountain trail, a forgotten village, a traditional dish or your next adventure, explore Macedonia through the things that interest you most.",["discover.nature"]="Nature",["discover.natureText"]="Mountains, lakes, forests, caves and landscapes waiting to be explored.",["discover.exploreNature"]="Explore nature",["discover.culture"]="Culture",["discover.cultureText"]="Villages, traditions, history and stories passed from one generation to another.",["discover.discoverCulture"]="Discover culture",["discover.food"]="Food & Local Life",["discover.foodText"]="Traditional dishes, local producers and the people behind Macedonia’s food culture.",["discover.taste"]="Taste Macedonia",["discover.adventure"]="Adventure",["discover.adventureText"]="Hiking, kayaking, camping and experiences designed for curious explorers.",["discover.findAdventure"]="Find an adventure",["discover.how"]="HOW IT WORKS",["discover.howTitle"]="Discover your own way.",["discover.howText"]="There is no single way to explore Macedonia. Pick something that interests you and let the journey take you from there.",["discover.step1"]="Choose what interests you",["discover.step1Text"]="Nature, culture, food or adventure — start wherever your curiosity takes you.",["discover.step2"]="Explore the possibilities",["discover.step2Text"]="Browse destinations, experiences and stories selected by HIDDEN MK.",["discover.step3"]="Go beyond the guidebook",["discover.step3Text"]="Choose something unexpected and create a journey that is actually yours.",["discover.start"]="START EXPLORING",["discover.places"]="Places worth getting lost in.",["discover.viewAll"]="View all destinations",["discover.finalEyebrow"]="NOT SURE W