["story.1.title"]="7 Places in Macedonia You Probably Haven’t Heard Of",["story.1.category"]="Travel Guide",["story.1.excerpt"]="Beyond the famous lakes and cities lies another Macedonia — quieter, wilder and full of surprises.",["story.1.author"]="HIDDEN MK Editorial",["story.1.date"]="September 12, 2026",["story.1.content"]="Macedonia is a small country with an incredible variety of landscapes. Beyond the destinations most travelers know, there are mountain villages, hidden trails, quiet lakes and forgotten places waiting to be explored.\n\nFrom the stone houses of Galičnik to the peaceful landscapes around Prespa, the best discoveries often happen when you leave the main road behind.\n\nAt HIDDEN MK, we believe that travel is about curiosity. Take the longer road, speak with a local and allow yourself to get a little lost.",["story.2.title"]="The Villages Where Time Moves Differently",["story.2.category"]="Local Stories",["story.2.excerpt"]="Some places don’t ask you to slow down. They simply make you realize that you already have.",["story.2.author"]="Elena Petrova",["story.2.date"]="August 28, 2026",["story.2.content"]="Across the mountains of Macedonia are villages where traditional architecture, food and customs remain part of everyday life.\n\nGaličnik, Lazaropole and other mountain communities offer a glimpse into a slower rhythm of life. Stone houses sit beneath enormous mountain landscapes, while local traditions continue to connect generations.\n\nFor travelers, these places offer something that cannot be found in a conventional tourist attraction: time to stop and simply be present.",["story.3.title"]="A Taste of Macedonia: Five Dishes Worth the Journey",["story.3.category"]="Food",["story.3.excerpt"]="Travel through food and discover the traditions behind some of Macedonia’s most beloved dishes.",["story.3.author"]="Ana Stojanovska",["story.3.date"]="August 14, 2026",["story.3.content"]="Food is one of the easiest ways to understand a place. Macedonian cuisine brings together simple ingredients, generations-old recipes and influences from across the Balkans.\n\nAjvar, tavče gravče, zelnik and fresh village cheese are just a few of the flavors worth discovering. But the real experience often comes from eating them where they were made.\n\nA meal prepared by a local family can become one of the most memorable parts of a journey.",["story.4.title"]="Why We Travel Beyond the Guidebook",["story.4.category"]="HIDDEN MK",["story.4.excerpt"]="The most memorable journeys rarely follow a checklist.",["story.4.author"]="HIDDEN MK Editorial",["story.4.date"]="July 30, 2026",["story.4.content"]="Travel has changed. It is no longer only about seeing as many famous places as possible. More travelers are looking for authentic experiences, local connections and destinations where they can slow down.\n\nThat idea is at the heart of HIDDEN MK. We want to help people discover a different side of Macedonia — one that is personal, unexpected and worth remembering.",
            ["about.title"]="There is more to Macedonia than meets the eye.",["about.eyebrow"]="ABOUT HIDDEN MK",["about.intro"]="HIDDEN MK is a discovery platform created for people who want to experience Macedonia beyond the usual tourist routes.",["about.storyEyebrow"]="OUR STORY",["about.storyTitle"]="We believe the best places are sometimes the hardest to find.",["about.story1"]="Macedonia is a small country with an incredible variety of landscapes, traditions, food and stories. Some of its most memorable experiences are hidden away from the main tourist routes.",["about.story2"]="HIDDEN MK was created to bring those places closer to curious travelers — from mountain villages and forgotten trails to local food, ancient traditions and unexpected adventures.",["about.story3"]="We don't simply tell people where to go. We want them to understand why a place matters.",["about.philosophy"]="OUR PHILOSOPHY",["about.philosophyText"]="Travel slower.<br />Look closer.<br />Discover more.",["about.values"]="WHAT WE VALUE",["about.moreThan"]="More than destinations.",["about.valuesIntro"]="HIDDEN MK is built around the idea that meaningful travel is about people, places and stories.",["about.value1Title"]="Authentic Discovery",["about.value1"]="We look beyond the obvious and highlight places that offer something genuinely different.",["about.value2Title"]="Local Stories",["about.value2"]="Every destination has people, traditions and stories worth hearing.",["about.value3Title"]="Respect for Nature",["about.value3"]="We encourage responsible exploration and respect for the landscapes we discover.",["about.idea"]="THE IDEA",["about.ideaTitle"]="A different way to explore Macedonia.",["about.ideaText"]="HIDDEN MK combines destination guides, local experiences and stories into one place. Whether you're planning your first visit or you've lived here your entire life, there is always something new to discover.",
            ["team.title"]="Our Team",["team.eyebrow"]="THE PEOPLE BEHIND HIDDEN MK",["team.heading"]="Meet the team.",["team.intro"]="A small team with a big curiosity for the places, people and stories that make Macedonia unique.",["team.label"]="OUR TEAM",["team.subtitle"]="Curious people. Different perspectives.",["team.role1"]="FOUNDER & CREATIVE DIRECTOR",["team.bio1"]="Elena turns forgotten places and local stories into experiences worth remembering.",["team.role2"]="TRAVEL & EXPERIENCE CURATOR",["team.bio2"]="A mountain enthusiast who is always searching for the next trail, village or hidden viewpoint.",["team.role3"]="FOOD & CULTURE EDITOR",["team.bio3"]="Ana explores Macedonia through its food, traditions and the people who keep them alive.",["team.role4"]="PHOTOGRAPHER & STORYTELLER",["team.bio4"]="David captures the landscapes and small moments that make every journey feel personal.",["team.join"]="WANT TO JOIN THE JOURNEY?",["team.joinTitle"]="Have a hidden place we should know about?",["team.joinText"]="We are always looking for local stories, unique experiences and places that deserve to be discovered.",["team.joinButton"]="Tell us about it",
            ["contact.title"]="Contact",["contact.eyebrow"]="GET IN TOUCH",["contact.hero"]="Have a place worth discovering?",["contact.heroText"]="Tell us about it. We are always looking for hidden places, local stories and unforgettable experiences.",["contact.label"]="CONTACT HIDDEN MK",["contact.heading"]="Let's discover something together.",["contact.text"]="Whether you have a question, a recommendation or a hidden place we should feature, we'd love to hear from you.",["contact.email"]="Email",["contact.based"]="Based in",["contact.available"]="Available",["contact.hours"]="Monday – Friday, 09:00 – 17:00",["contact.follow"]="FOLLOW THE JOURNEY",["contact.send"]="SEND A MESSAGE",["contact.formHeading"]="Tell us what's on your mind.",["contact.name"]="Your name",["contact.emailPlaceholder"]="you@example.com",["contact.subject"]="Subject",["contact.subjectPlaceholder"]="What would you like to tell us?",["contact.message"]="Message",["contact.messagePlaceholder"]="Tell us about a place, experience or question...",["contact.sendButton"]="Send message",["contact.successTitle"]="Message sent!",["contact.success"]="Thank you for reaching out. Your message has been received.",["contact.location"]="Skopje, Macedonia",["contact.locationText"]="The starting point of our journey.",
