            ["faq.title"]="FAQ",["faq.eyebrow"]="FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS",["faq.heading"]="Everything you need to know before you start discovering Macedonia.",["faq.q1"]="What is HIDDEN MK?",["faq.a1"]="HIDDEN MK is a discovery platform focused on hidden places, local stories, food, nature and unique experiences across Macedonia.",["faq.q2"]="Do I need a guide to explore these places?",["faq.a2"]="No. HIDDEN MK is primarily a discovery platform. Some experiences may benefit from a local guide, but our goal is to highlight destinations and experiences you can explore at your own pace.",["faq.q3"]="Are the experiences bookable?",["faq.a3"]="The experiences are presented as inspiration and discovery. Where relevant, an experience includes information about what to expect and how to plan it.",["faq.q4"]="When is the best time to explore Macedonia?",["faq.a4"]="It depends on the experience. Spring and autumn are excellent for hiking and exploring villages, while summer is ideal for lakes and outdoor adventures.",["faq.q5"]="Can I recommend a hidden place?",["faq.a5"]="Absolutely. We are always interested in discovering new places and local stories. Send us your recommendation through our contact page.",["faq.q6"]="How can I contact HIDDEN MK?",["faq.a6"]="You can use our contact form or email us directly at hello@hiddenmk.com.",["faq.still"]="STILL CURIOUS?",["faq.ask"]="Ask us anything.",["faq.more"]="If you couldn't find your answer above, get in touch with our team.",
