            ["terms.title"]="Terms & Conditions",["terms.hero"]="The basic terms for using the HIDDEN MK website.",["terms.1h"]="1. Website purpose",["terms.1"]="HIDDEN MK provides travel inspiration, destination information, stories and recommendations related to Macedonia.",["terms.2h"]="2. Information accuracy",["terms.2"]="We aim to provide useful and accurate information. However, conditions at destinations, opening times, accessibility and other circumstances may change. Visitors should verify important information before travelling.",["terms.3h"]="3. User submissions",["terms.3"]="By submitting information through the contact form, you confirm that the information provided is your own or that you have permission to share it.",["terms.4h"]="4. Intellectual property",["terms.4"]="Website content, branding, text and design elements created for HIDDEN MK are intended for use by the HIDDEN MK platform unless otherwise stated.",["terms.5h"]="5. External links",["terms.5"]="HIDDEN MK may contain links to external websites. We are not responsible for the content, availability or policies of external websites.",["terms.6h"]="6. Responsible exploration",["terms.6"]="Visitors are encouraged to respect nature, local communities, cultural heritage and applicable rules when exploring destinations featured on HIDDEN MK.",["terms.7h"]="7. Changes to these terms",["terms.7"]="HIDDEN MK may update these Terms & Conditions when necessary. The latest version will be published on this page.",
